    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. Paddle's first checkout pop-up says \"Purchase Restoro 1 Year,\" shows the current total, and places \"Then $41.95/year\" in smaller text without explaining the subscription terms.\nLEGAL REASONING. The complaint alleges the pop-up did not require affirmative authorization of an auto-renewing subscription and did not explain the negative-option plan terms.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a); ROSCA Section 4(1)-(2), 15 U.S.C. 8403(1)-(2).",
